@api = http://localhost:8080
@email = me@example.com
@password = correct-horse-battery

### Health (checks database connectivity)
GET {{api}}/health

### Register → 201, access token in body, refresh token in httpOnly cookie
# @name register
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "displayName": "أحمد", "locale": "ar" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Who am I (paste the accessToken from login/register)
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
GET {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update profile (null/omitted = unchanged, "" avatarUrl = remove)
PATCH {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locale": "en" }

### Change password (signs out other sessions, returns a fresh one)
PUT {{api}}/api/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{password}}", "newPassword": "another-strong-password" }

### Refresh (uses the cookie; the CSRF header is mandatory)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

### Logout (revokes this session's refresh tokens and clears the cookie)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
